  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original whole-organism short-necked sauropod with terminal spiked bony club. [\"Zhang1988 positions small dermal tail spines on T5401 and revised diagnosis mentions two pairs; whether fossils found articulated is not established here. Do not claim in-situ proven location.\", \"Skin colour muscle volume and neutral pose inferred.\", \"Do not copy drooping historical mount pose or modern artwork.\", \"Use modest relative spike size; avoid dramatic Stegosaurus thagomizer.\"] {\"total_length_m\": 10, \"basis\": \"NHM Dino Directory genus estimate, not exact measurement of T5401.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original whole-organism short-necked sauropod with terminal spiked bony club. [\"Zhang1988 positions small dermal tail spines on T5401 and revised diagnosis mentions two pairs; whether fossils found articulated is not established here. Do not claim in-situ proven location.\", \"Skin colour muscle volume and neutral pose inferred.\", \"Do not copy drooping historical mount pose or modern artwork.\", \"Use modest relative spike size; avoid dramatic Stegosaurus thagomizer.\"] {\"total_length_m\": 10, \"basis\": \"NHM Dino Directory genus estimate, not exact measurement of T5401.\"}"
  },
